# Implementation Plan - Phase 2 Completion & Phase 3 (Purchase & Batching)

This plan outlines the next steps to complete the Product Catalog and implement the Purchase & Batching system for Inventry Pro Foods.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Batch Numbering:** Should batch numbers be auto-generated (e.g., BN-YYYYMMDD-XXX) or manually entered based on supplier labels?
> **Tax Implementation:** Should PO amounts include GST/Tax automatically, or should they be entered as gross totals?

